{"items":[{"id":"792414295","root":"792413546","user":{"id":"348627","name":"渣丸子","avatar":"6bff8965b006724a4d9551ef"},"text":"是，王大陆篇不合理的地方太多了，就是为了冲突点满编了太多不合理的桥段，我还能说别的，比如在广州这种地方，黑恶势力居然敢直接控制王大陆父母，还摔死王大陆他们家的猫，更逗的是，看着拥有两套接近千万房产的高收入家庭，居然不乐意等他们取一百万还债，拉着王大陆去卖血（好奇现在国内还有这种黑医院卖血吗）而且完全不担心闹出人命，拉着连着几家医院抽，这确定是中国吗[emot=acfun,1657/]","time":1691888269121,"floor":1,"likes":2,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792415288","root":"792413546","user":{"id":"26480558","name":"千散龙儿","avatar":"227b4cda11e2a6d44b77d3c3"},"text":"确实，这么一想王大陆的家庭背景好像根本不需要玩赌博………","time":1691892372349,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"渣丸子","replyToUserId":"348627","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792416723","root":"792413546","user":{"id":"348627","name":"渣丸子","avatar":"6bff8965b006724a4d9551ef"},"text":"电影可能是出于教化宣传都需要，特意拔高了受骗者的学历与家庭层次，不仅是王大陆，张艺兴是大厂k6程序员，电影开始就用了连这种精英也会出事作为开始（电影开场白），估计是想给看电影的人说，连这种人都会，你可长点心吧，不过意思是好的，就是用力过猛","time":1691897378329,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"千散龙儿","replyToUserId":"26480558","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}],"media":{"227b4cda11e2a6d44b77d3c3":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/bs2/acfun-image/26480558_2aad4cb4f1b842f89e548103834cdd08.png","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/cms/2020_04_30/1588257381560.png?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/newUpload/26480558_2aad4cb4f1b842f89e548103834cdd08.png"]},"6bff8965b006724a4d9551ef":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/content/2020_12_26/1.608993900546948E9.png?imageslim","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/kimg/bs2/zt-image-host/ChYwOGNjYTdkNjA1MTA5OWIzYTFmYzA1EKvK1y8.webp","https://ali-imgs.acfun.cn/kimg/bs2/zt-image-host/ChYwOGNjYTdkNjA1MTA5OWIzYTFmYzA1EKvK1y8.webp"]}},"emotions":{"acfun,1657":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/bs2/acfun-image/1657_12f3ac4bc6e24a5dac92fadacb22d852","fallbacks":[],"name":"迷你AC 20"}}}